# R20 wave 4 (review 2026-11-01): B2–C2 Echo Well 40 → 60 prompts and Story Quill 10 → 15 tasks per level (hand-written, topics for older children).
# Same shape as tools/r20c.py (wave 3): per level +10 read-aloud (a new sound / stress / structure focus each) and +10 free-answer prompts.
# Appended last in build_data.py (R20_WAVES) so every old id stays the same.
# Free-answer keywords are written without contractions ("would love to", "it is a good idea"): js/speaking.js expands "I'd", "it's" … before matching.
